[00:26.40][music: verse 1]
[00:29.58]Her car was a '97 Civic with a tape deck that ate my best mixes
[00:35.94]We'd park at the reservoir where the lights from the city made everything soft
[00:42.29]She didn't like the lyrics but she liked how I sang them
[00:48.65]She said my voice made her feel like the room was underwater
[00:55.00]Like the room was underwater
[01:01.36][Pre-Chorus]
